    "title": "House Oversight Committee Demands CIA Return JFK and MKUltra Files Seized From DNI",
    "text": "The US House Committee on Oversight and Government Reform put the CIA on notice Wednesday after a whistleblower testified that the agency had seized from the Office of the Director of National Intelligence (ODNI) 40 boxes of JFK files and MK Ultra files that were in the process of being declassified.\nJames Erdman III, a current senior CIA operations officer, made the stunning claim during a Senate Homeland Security Committee hearing, Wednesday morning.\nRead Full Article: https://amgreatness.com/2026/05/13/house-oversight-committee-demands-cia-return-jfk-and-mkultra-files-seized-from-dni/",
